[{:db/id 17592186119773 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-f2f19b4d-d8c8-5ecf-9fc4-030f5c14f82f"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-f2f19b4d-d8c8-5ecf-9fc4-030f5c14f82f" :question/id #uuid "f2f19b4d-d8c8-5ecf-9fc4-030f5c14f82f" :question/math-academy-id "q-77803" :question/problem "Compute the following determinant using a cofactor expansion along the $3$rd row:\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}|.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using cofactor expansion along the $3$rd row, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}| & =0\\cdot {C}_{31}+0\\cdot {C}_{32}+4\\cdot {C}_{33}+3\\cdot {C}_{34} \\\\  & =4\\cdot (-1)^{3+3}\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}|+3\\cdot (-1)^{3+4}\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =4\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}|-3\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the first $3\\times 3$ determinant by applying a Laplace expansion along the $2$nd row, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}| & =0\\cdot {C}_{21}+(-2)\\cdot {C}_{22}+(-4)\\cdot {C}_{23} \\\\  & =(-2)\\cdot (-1)^{2+2}\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|+(-4)\\cdot (-1)^{2+3}\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|+4\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-2(6-0)+4(0-2) \\\\  & =-12-8 \\\\  & =-20\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the second  $3\\times 3$ determinant by applying a Laplace expansion along the $3$rd row, we obtain: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}| & =1\\cdot {C}_{31}+0\\cdot {C}_{32}+-1\\cdot {C}_{33} \\\\  & =1\\cdot (-1)^{3+1}\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{aligned}|+(-1)\\cdot (-1)^{3+3}\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{aligned}|-|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-6+2)-(-6-0) \\\\  & =-4+6 \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}|=4(-20)-3(2)=-86.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-836f09e9-0332-59b3-a2c7-f5f742bda069"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-836f09e9-0332-59b3-a2c7-f5f742bda069" :answer-field/id #uuid "836f09e9-0332-59b3-a2c7-f5f742bda069" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-eec09744-a423-5762-9061-2c0d2667e27b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-67de8883-fc93-5260-a637-aad0f0e00eaf" "answer-eec09744-a423-5762-9061-2c0d2667e27b" "answer-3f4bae87-8e07-5dc7-9219-6f715b2ead18" "answer-9ad5be32-123d-550b-a8af-5eb97cc44261" "answer-a3bfe935-3937-5ddc-93c2-d9d7115d3c4b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-67de8883-fc93-5260-a637-aad0f0e00eaf" :answer/id #uuid "67de8883-fc93-5260-a637-aad0f0e00eaf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-60" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-eec09744-a423-5762-9061-2c0d2667e27b" :answer/id #uuid "eec09744-a423-5762-9061-2c0d2667e27b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-86" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3f4bae87-8e07-5dc7-9219-6f715b2ead18" :answer/id #uuid "3f4bae87-8e07-5dc7-9219-6f715b2ead18" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "72" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9ad5be32-123d-550b-a8af-5eb97cc44261" :answer/id #uuid "9ad5be32-123d-550b-a8af-5eb97cc44261" :answer/type 